                                                           "A core ODP of the CEON ontology network, defining aspects of the value concept." ,
                                                           "A core module of the CEON ontology network, defining aspects of the circular value network (CVN) itself." ,
                                                           "A module of the CEON ontology network defining aspects of the energy concept." ,
                                                           "A module the CEON ontology network, defining aspects of the location concept." ,
                                                           "A module to represent statements of CEON resources." ,
                                                           "The Actor module of CEON (Circular Economy Ontology Network)." ,
                                                           "The Material module of CEON (Circular Economy Ontology Network)." ,
                                                           "The Process module of CEON (Circular Economy Ontology Network)." ,
                                                           "The Product module of CEON (Circular Economy Ontology Network)." ,
                                                           "The full module of CEON (Circular Economy Ontology Network)." ;
